{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e971de0681929a06d4783256a8c89a646c765c40cabc8c5808c2ccb5e2e6da9b", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\nそろそろ杏奈が着替え終わるはずだが……）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。杏奈差不多该换好衣服了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdcb2d3b95c976de1884b30e51e57bd9e790e326e30bfd5168436c028176dba3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nどう、かな……。似合って……ますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n觉得怎么样……？适合我……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a12d543680afecccd7d7002918bbb4e2edd78cf8858d676ba97c693f87a8e05", "ja": "うん、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得挺好的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "aa74da366bc746eb1612e5a12d96e73685d0ad0b7808018f675fb626134314cc", "ja": "ん……よかった、です……。杏奈も……\nこういう服、着れて……すごく、嬉しい……。", "zh": "嗯……太好、了……。杏奈也……\n能穿上这样的衣服……真的、好开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "7a30664ff23ca1995e846b596e2e5936739c532fa4fd84c50a0f153fc8df9f6b", "ja": "ゲームの、オシャレ装備、みたい……。\nレア度が、高くて……手に入らないの……。", "zh": "就像游戏里的时髦装备……  \n稀有度太高了……根本拿不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d335a10f99c2a841e3ead802da75f566025be5ba83491d33d49b4efbf504cb99", "ja": "そうか……言われてみると、\nゲームだとそうかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……仔细想想，\n游戏里好像确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "9d64517c504ba5deefcd4f16fe969016cf089f7287a68511b888b6eae38714ba", "ja": "防御力は、ない、けど……。\n可愛いから……人気、ある、よ……。", "zh": "虽然……没有防御力……\n但因为可爱……很受欢迎……哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "eb2bd2a53b784ed0f7022a84594dabf6f2739e32c5684806defd02410dfced87", "ja": "{$P$}さん……この衣装、\nくれて……ありがとう……です。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……这套服装，谢谢你送给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1008_p", "source_sha256": "090d589c085e73f2855a36c3209d0c2c81a92c518a8001fe87234a43260a49e9", "ja": "こちらこそ、喜んでもらえて何よりだよ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你，能让你喜欢就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "1d4ff2a0144d0cfaca2d51c4097e8965fe3689a66b31d8137a28343aa7007a40", "ja": "ん……♪　それで……えと……ちょっと、\n欲しくなって……きちゃった……。", "zh": "嗯……♪ 然后……那个……有点，\n变得……想要了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "e7b8c0e5460feddba98b3b53d27627ef132f0a801741464cb424636265483126", "ja": "ゲームの中の……ワンピース。\nでも、手に入れるの……かなり難しい……。", "zh": "游戏里的……连衣裙。\n不过，想要拿到……相当困难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa39ecd3bd6739450c744b5af0e37304fd66f5b5bcd3743429820db77a2d3498", "ja": "合成素材、全部レア、だから……。\n今までは、趣味装備だって……諦めて、ました……。", "zh": "合成素材，全都是稀有材料，所以……\n之前我都当成是外观装备……放弃、了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc0e508602676fa4f31a9925125098e6810650fe6b0c45b76ca46e0330d6380a", "ja": "杏奈が諦めるレベルなのか？\nそれは、なんと言うか……相当だな。", "zh": "已经到了连杏奈都会放弃的程度吗？\n那还真是……相当严重啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "02fcf20e6ba6c6ab187e5b3783e197f8a96f3eea6f0dbbb2bba72b05dc25408b", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さん……ワンピース、\n似合ってるって……言って、くれたから……。", "zh": "可是，{$P$}先生说……这条连衣裙，很适合我……因为他这么说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "44c7bbd512c00717071e30c8a80dfdc06cc793679457cd904b2f80bf5b216a99", "ja": "絶対……手に入れ、ます……。\n杏奈の、キャラにも……似合うと、思う……おそろい。", "zh": "绝对……要拿到……。\n我觉得……这套同款也很适合杏奈的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "80db8d615252b76e6bae7eebb11c8895ad29bc5578c1fddc9d4f8323b48815ce", "ja": "おお、気合いが入ってるな！\nでもまずは、今日の撮影を頼むぞ？", "zh": "哦，干劲十足嘛！\n不过，先拜托你完成今天的拍摄吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc938f477954366d5534c97fd48fe5861d0c4d49982238a6df050becc4234eb9", "ja": "もちろん……です。杏奈、頑張る……。\nこっちも、気合い、入ってます……。", "zh": "当然……会努力的。杏奈，会加油的……。\n这边也，干劲，十足哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7c116bd2ee6b62446d0bd6c0a33af72d24562b89ead7333d918a3b61fdcaeaa9", "ja": "よし！　後で俺もそのゲーム手伝うよ。\n取り方も、教えてもらえるか？", "zh": "好！之后我也来帮你玩那个游戏。\n能教教我怎么获得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "f48f1ef7003b93b3bbc7788354cce506efbe531d805707f4027727d580ca6baa", "ja": "え……。いいの……？\n一緒に、ゲーム……してくれるの……？", "zh": "诶……可以吗……？\n你愿意陪我一起……玩游戏吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1019_p", "source_sha256": "194e9ef6a20993aad48921d769220c3f989cb7eac88ef0d56079e12c8c0e2a9b", "ja": "ああ。ただし、撮影が終わったらな！", "zh": "嗯。不过，要等拍摄结束之后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "fda1dda665a2de30c9567555922785b3cc7254ff3426f0a7cc36bff609457f2b", "ja": "……♪　杏奈……撮影、がんばるね……。\n見てて……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "……♪　杏奈……会努力拍摄的……。\n要看着我哦……{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8847858783e5ee4e769d88a1067f0e4077c474ff1956038e2cdacc7e1a0fdc02", "ja": "（その後、杏奈の頑張りのおかげで、\n撮影は予定よりも早く終わった！）", "zh": "（之后，多亏杏奈努力，拍摄比预定时间更早结束了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0213_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b296e199341f4d94d3814c66f7c6e018316a41723c72b8498a6ca4bb4ea88e3", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　杏奈、頑張ったよ！\nビビッとレアアイテム、よろしくです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！杏奈，很努力了哦！\n哔哔一下的稀有道具，就拜托你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
